            "review_title": "Review at Double B's Coffee & Brunch",
            "review_text": "debcarhill\nPerth, Australia29 contributions\n0\nBest place to eat in Tay Ho , hands down\nAug 2025\nWhat can I say about Double B’s except WOW. Do yourself a favour if you are in Tay Ho and come here. Food is impeccable and we know because we keep coming back, it’s that good. Working our way through the menu but the beef and pork vermicelli is seriously the best thing I have ever eaten in Vietnam. Breakfast also delightful.\nInsider tip:\nGreat food and service , free wifi , air con and fans for outside .\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 13, 2025",
