            "review_text": "Elbi D\nHanoi, Vietnam3 contributions\n0\nCozy and lake view restaurant in Tay Ho\nAug 2025\nThe cafe has beautiful view in front of the lake, yet it's peaceful and perfect with your favourite book in the morning. The foods are really tasty and fresh, I ordered pork and prawn paper rolls and salmon pattie burger is the best I've tried. Salted coffee is a must.. Really recommend for every one.\nInsider tip:\nFresh and clean restaurant\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 7, 2025",
