            "review_text": "ron12345100\nPerth, Australia22 contributions\n0\nAwesome food, next to the lake. Cafe is clean and the staff are friendly and helpful. The meals were perfect\nAug 2025 • Couples\nQuiet little cafe in a nice location. It’s extremely clean and neat. Great staff that are super friendly.\n\nThe beef vermicelli was perfectly balanced, great flavour and the salad was so fresh. The spring rolls were great too.\n\nThe best meal I’ve had in Vietnam.\n\nNice menu too this is my new favourite place to eat\nRead more\nWritten August 6, 2025",
