            "review_text": "TanjungBaraDiver\nHanoi, Vietnam1974 contributions\n0\nExcellent brunch spot in a relatively quiet location\nJan 2025 • Couples\nWe've just moved to the area and this place is just down the road, and we'll be back in future. It's reasonably quiet although the usual bike/car horns can get irritating. There's indoor and outdoor seating, and quite a few books inside if that's what takes your fancy. Staff were great although it was very quiet (we were probably first customers of the day). I'm not sure what it's like when it is busy. I had the omelette and my wife had the Eggs Benedict, it has most of the brunch staples but there are some Viet things thrown in as well. Coffee is also pretty good. Prices are reasonable and we'll be trying it out again soon.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 20, 2025",
